# Database layer

Shared entities at `src/db/` root; league-specific gameplay under `src/db/<league>/` (e.g. `wc/`). `mod.rs` only runs `migrate::run` and re-exports public types.

- Methods take `&Connection`, return `rusqlite::Result<T>`.
- No HTTP, Discord, or poise imports in `db/`.
- Schema changes go in `migrate.rs` with a version bump.
- Gameplay data is scoped by `season_id`.
- Active season: `GuildConfig` → `Season::default_for_guild`. Do not hardcode season ids in commands.

World Cup tables (`wc_*` SQL names): accessors in `db/wc/` — `WcMatchResult`, `WcProcessedMatch`, `WcPlayerGoalTotal`, `WcTiebreakerPick`.
